  "notes": "Holt County (State Auditor), cash basis, FY ended June 30, 2024. Statement p4 Total Governmental Funds column; beginning/ending are cash basis fund balances; no investments reported. Statement Taxes: Other 331,644 split: Visitors Promotion/Improvement funds 178,802 = lodging tax (fund name), remainder 152,842 stays printed Other taxes. Capital Projects 190,551 (COVID ARPA fund) recorded as capital outlay. Balance sheet: Statement of Cash Basis Assets and Fund Balances - Governmental Funds (p3) Total column; totals equal p1. Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p5-6), Taxes 10,543,763 split using the p4 General Fund column (budget 10,783,078 for the whole line, so budget_final null on pieces); Road Fund Taxes 189 split from p4 Road column (budget 184); major funds Road, Inheritance, Construction Asphalt (p7-8); nonmajor funds via Total Nonmajor Funds column of the combining statement (p13-15) since there are 17 funds; per-fund nonmajor budget schedules (p9-12) not recorded to avoid double counting. Read pages 1-15 of 15"
